  "notes": "Förskoleklass (compulsory, from age 6) is excluded as pre-primary. Reform: from autumn 2028 the grundskola becomes ten years (SFS 2025:729); förskoleklass becomes a new årskurs 1 at age 6, every later year moves up one number (lågstadiet 1–4, mellanstadiet 5–7, högstadiet 8–10), and this file will need replacing. Gymnasieskolan national programmes are intended to take three school years."
